LLB toolchain image -- third-party software and licences

This image bundles third-party software so that ligand_library_builder (LLB)
runs the same way on any cluster. LLB's own code is not in the image. The exact
versions, commits and checksums are in /opt/llb/manifest.json. Licence texts are
in /opt/llb/licenses/.

AMSOL 7.1, DOCK-patched build                    /opt/db2_converter/db2_converter/amsol/amsol7.1_patched
  Licence: Apache License 2.0 (licenses/AMSOL-Apache-2.0.txt).
  Original: AMSOL 7.1, Truhlar group, University of Minnesota
  (http://comp.chem.umn.edu/amsol/).
  Modified: this is the DOCK-patched build (https://wiki.docking.org/index.php/AMSOL)
  as shipped in db2_converter 63d6656, with include/SIZES.i raised from
  MAXHEV=60, MAXLIT=60 to MAXHEV=80, MAXLIT=110 and recompiled
  (db2_converter/amsol/README.md). LLB redistributes that binary unchanged.

