  README asks every user to make.

Conda environments                               /opt/conda/envs/{qupkake,db2_converter,llb_pka}
  Installed from LLB's environments/*.linux-64.lock (conda-forge and PyPI
  packages, each under its own licence, recorded in each package's metadata
  under the environment's conda-meta/ and site-packages/*.dist-info/).
  Includes AmberTools, Open Babel (GPL-2.0), RDKit (BSD-3-Clause), PyTorch
  (BSD-3-Clause), PoseBusters (BSD-3-Clause) and dimorphite_dl (Apache-2.0).

